```

Label theme type: 'normal'|'info'|'danger'|'warning'|'success'|'utility'|'unknown'|'clear'. Good.

Data: generate ~24 orders statically with fixed names (Russian customers), dates, totals. Build groups:

```ts
const buildGroups = (orders: Order[]): RowData[] =>
  STATUS_ORDER.map((status) => ({
    id: `group-${status}`,
    status,
    orders: orders.filter((o) => o.status === status),
